BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (without resale 'we probably wouldn't be able to afford health care.' The bright line everyone respects is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (remanufacturing. Servicing cannot change intended use. Remanufacturing significantly changes performance, safety, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (intended use and falls outside the servicing community's scope entirely. Independents protect their model by keeping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (repairs inside servicing [lSIrqUmOamc @ 00:11:38].) Tj ET
