BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (ranks Type B as the least stringent, Type BF as less stringent than CF, and Type CF, built for direct conductive contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (with the heart, as the most stringent; Type B applied parts may be connected to earth while BF and CF parts float and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (must be separated from earth, and the channel's closing advice is that every manufacturer has their own protocols) Tj ET
