BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.87 Tm (recurring rejects. They include editing the PDF in a browser instead of Adobe Reader, a wrong fiscal year or Org ID,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 433.65 Tm (and not summing receipts on the tax forms. They also include a signer who does not match line 4 and certification by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.42 Tm (an accountant instead of the national tax authority. Submit at least 60 days ahead, since the SBD covers one fiscal year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.20 Tm (only. Qualify before any acquisition, because the parent's receipts then count. Front-door failures cost time instead of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.97 Tm (cash. Prime Path Medtech says an unpaid fee triggers a hold letter and that an RTA hold gives 180 days to fix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.75 Tm ([0CrtB8E2n30 @ 00:02:34]. leanRAQA reports that a wrong product code, such as FXX against an antimicrobial) Tj ET
