BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.72 Tm (corrective action, which should make you question the investigation itself. The second is identifying an action and then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.50 Tm (never implementing it. His baseline rule is that if it wasn't documented, it didn't occur. Physical controls matter too:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.27 Tm (Ruth B. Diaco says non-conforming product must still be physically segregated even when a system block exists.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.05 Tm (Invent Healthcare's eMDR panel says relabelers and repackagers are manufacturers for MDR purposes. It also says a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.82 Tm (production account takes two to six weeks, which is why the panel says to set up eMDR early against the 30-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.60 Tm (deadline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 144.37 Tm (Distribution and labeling traps hit resellers and importers directly. Isaac Erickson says a distributor can file a 510\(k\) as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.15 Tm (applicant if it has access to the manufacturer's documents, and that whoever holds the 510\(k\) controls the US market.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.92 Tm (His warning, from 15-plus years of experience, is not to trust manufacturers to prioritize you [TChhZNirpeM @) Tj ET
