BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (small-business fee at about $5,000 for firms under $100M, requiring Form 3602/3602A plus a tax return, two to six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (weeks to process, and yearly renewal; wholly owned subsidiaries must demonstrate independence to claim the discount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([1GKnWm8UYVk @ 00:37:33]. In a second Joe Hage session Rob quotes consultant fees from $10K to $150K, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (most landing between $20K and $25K, and prices the job out loud: about 100 hours at $250 an hour is 25 grand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm ([gGje01O9B44 @ 01:20:17]. Pre-sub prep runs about 10 hours, roughly $2,500, and Packard says pre-sub feedback,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (while non-binding, saves $10k-plus [-ceDuiClggg @ 01:20:57].) Tj ET
