BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 510.55 Tm (rejected during that RTA screening,' that the checklist runs 26 to 27 pages, and that a rejection resets the review clock) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.32 Tm (to zero [-ceDuiClggg @ 00:13:03]. His longer MedicalMarcom session drills into the cause: 54% of rejections cite) Tj ET
