BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm ('pushback' that not every event reaches MAUDE, and that exemptions, variances and alternative reporting are excluded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm ([0dpHnJj93Ns @ 00:00:25]. Smart also lists underreporting, late-arriving reports, redactions, and FDA's own statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (that MAUDE cannot assess prevalence. Bernstein's rule closes the loop: a record is not causation, so public data has to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (be cross-checked against manufacturer claims, patient records and FDA findings before anyone builds a decision on it.) Tj ET
