BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Bench mechanics on the two most-shown platforms are short and repeatable. The Derma Glow's Candela Pro sequence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (plug in, flip the breaker on the back and confirm the green light, check the water level, then allow a couple of minutes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (to boot before skipping the two instruction screens [iZqTo4cU3Po @ 00:00:07]. The main screen sets fluence in joules) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (per square centimeter, pulse width, and lasing speed, while the right panel controls DCD gas amount and flow, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (standard values of 40 on 30 [iZqTo4cU3Po @ 00:01:27]. Calibration runs about 30 seconds, then the unit switches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (from standby to ready either on screen or through a button on the handpiece, and a built-in menu proposes spot size,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (fluence, and speed from hair color, hair thickness, skin tone, and tan status [iZqTo4cU3Po @ 00:02:51]. The Cynosure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (Elite Plus runs a similar loop: refill the tank with distilled water through the connector and funnel, let the device warm) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (up and adjust its voltage for several minutes, choose 755 or 1064, set fluence, confirm the handpiece size between 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (and 24 mm, press standby, press system check to calibrate, then press ready and wait for the green light to stop flashing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm ([44PIaui50ww @ 00:03:56]. The same Elite Plus walkthrough names the red emergency button as the instant shutdown) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (for any session.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (Throughput and menu breadth are where the hair-removal numbers live. Marianne Urban said the newer GentleMax) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (Pro spot sizes reach 24 mm at 2 Hz, so a full-leg treatment runs about 45 minutes even with breaks to check tolerance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (and skin response [2a1E_LFIa6I @ 00:00:32]. The same platform drops the alexandrite to a 3 to 5 mm spot for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (sunspots and solar lentigines already screened by a dermatologist, and uses the 1064 for telangiectasias around the nose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (and cherry angiomas, add-on services Urban said clients really appreciate [2a1E_LFIa6I @ 00:01:16]. Dr. Azi Shirazi) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (schedules sessions every six weeks, recommends three to five sessions plus maintenance once or twice a year, numbs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (patients for 30 minutes to an hour in a dedicated nook, and uses an IPL/BBL handpiece to cut back and leg sessions to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (roughly half the time before switching heavy-hair patients to the laser [lY2Cys5Df0c @ 00:08:49]. Shirazi also flagged) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (the IPL tradeoff: less potent, more sessions, and a higher burn risk on darker skin because it generates surface heat. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (the vascular and texture side, Dr. Eric Bernstein's DermaV green-light work was priced between 250 and 800 dollars) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (depending on the target, with spray cooling and roll-and-fire delivery that makes it extremely fast [NP8OXlNO1lE @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (00:01:20].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (The credentialing clock is the hidden carrying cost on every laser deal. K-Laser Australia lays out the Queensland) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (sequence: a user license application with a laser safety certificate and justice-of-the-peace-certified documents waits an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (average of 5 to 8 weeks, a clinic without a laser needs a possession license that takes about 2 to 3 months and must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (include an RSPP written for the clinic, its applications, and the specific apparatus, and only then does an approval to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (acquire, usually 1 to 2 weeks, let the supplier deliver [Hsmu9JQR5UM @ 00:05:14]. K-Laser pitches a free laser safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (course already known to Queensland Radiation Health to shorten that file. Trainee licensees must log supervised) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (practice hours under anyone holding a full license [Hsmu9JQR5UM @ 00:03:58]. Gregory Abston of the NCLC sets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (the operator exam math: a passing score of 70, at least 30 days before a retest, results within about two weeks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (certification active for three years, and renewal backed by 24 or more hours of continuing education [KPlnFyWRwTQ) Tj ET
