BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.10 Tm (Items: Change factory interlock and key codes on arrival: Dennis had a laser whose code was 56 78, a code she said) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.87 Tm (everybody in the United States had, so anyone could access it [OR Today Magazine - 4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:19:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.65 Tm (Verify electrical service before moving a big unit: Dennis's team tried to roll an excimer laser to the cath lab and found) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 265.42 Tm (it needed a 50 amp plug the room did not have, so the biomed had to step in [TechNation TV - kBlmK6r6MgU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.20 Tm (00:17:24].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.97 Tm (Know what is under the skin: biomed engineer Leslie Pard told Dennis that on a small holmium you can take the skin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.75 Tm (off and change average power from 15 to 30 watts; Dennis refused to touch it and leaves blast-shield swaps to biomeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.52 Tm ([TechNation TV - kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:15:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 189.30 Tm (Keep cooling attached to the handpiece: Marianne Urban runs both cryogen and cold-air platforms so clients can pick,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.07 Tm (and keeps the cold-air tube on the handpiece so nobody pulls the cooling off the skin [Laser Coach - IOSA5f1D4nI @) Tj ET
