BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.77 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.55 Tm (The most expensive trap is assuming whoever brought the laser owns the safety program. Patty Owens is blunt that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 264.32 Tm (rental and leasing companies sending technicians 'are not your LSO and they do not provide you a laser safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.10 Tm (program,' and if that company takes case data back to bill the hospital, the facility is releasing PHI and needs either) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 233.87 Tm (patient consent or a signed business associate agreement [4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:36:30]. Dennis hears the same excuse) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 218.65 Tm (constantly, 'the rental company is our LSO,' and answers that it is your patient in your institution, so the responsibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 203.42 Tm (stays with you [kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:07:38]. Hardware that changes hands carries its own landmine: Dennis describes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 188.20 Tm (an older laser whose interlock code was 5678, a code 'everybody in the United States had,' so the code had to be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 172.97 Tm (changed to keep anybody and everybody from accessing it [4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:19:37]. Owens adds that CMS-driven) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 157.75 Tm (accreditors expect a detailed inventory of every laser, leased, rented, borrowed or purchased, listing wavelength,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 142.52 Tm (classification, manufacturer, location, purchase date, maintenance and service records, usually held with biomed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 127.30 Tm ([4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:33:02]. A unit that arrives without that paper trail drops straight into a survey gap with Joint) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.07 Tm (Commission, Quad A or DNV surveyors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 96.85 Tm (Biomed-level failures show up when clinical staff improvise. Dennis recalls a last job where staff assumed an excimer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 81.62 Tm (laser for cardiac procedures could simply be rolled downstairs to the cath lab; it needed a 50 amp plug the room did not) Tj ET
