BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (have, and Dennis had to pull the biomed in to stop it [kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:17:08]. The same talk flags nurses and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (techs jerking plugs from the wall and reaching for extension or cheater cords on powerful lasers, plus a biomed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (colleague pointing out that taking the skin off a small holmium unit lets the average power be changed from 15 to 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (watts, which Dennis flatly refused to do [kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:15:38]. Skipping paperwork is the quieter failure.) Tj ET
